join detective right
detective: The murder was done with a stake. 
join detective left
detective: You must have a few of those yourself for the garden.
gardener: Y-yes, I s’pose so.
gardener: They’re awfully helpful for marking out garden beds ‘n such.
gardener: ...
gardener: I was actually working on that earlier, but two of my stakes were missing.
gardener (antsy): I s’pose Dracula found one of them.
